#====================================================================
# DRAFT-augustus-module-findsdl2-cache-vars
# 触发事件: augustus-game 4.0.0 HarmonyOS PC 适配（2026-08-26）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-augustus-module-findsdl2-cache-vars (similar_to E285)
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan|CMakeToolchain
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        Could NOT find SDL2|find_package\(SDL2 REQUIRED\).*CONFIG.*MODULE|
                        SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR.*NOTFOUND|SDL2_LIBRARY.*NOTFOUND|
                        Could not find SDL2_mixer

severity:               2
category:               cmake, find-module, sdl2, conan, dependency-injection
match_keywords:         FindSDL2, MODULE mode, CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH, SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR,
                        SDL2_LIBRARY_TEMP, FIND_LIBRARY, sdl2 package folder,
                        cache variable injection, CMakeToolchain, tc.variables

title:                  MODULE 模式自带 FindSDL2 不消费 CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH，需经缓存变量注入依赖路径

root_cause: >
  部分上游项目（augustus、Julius 系）在 cmake/ 目录自带 FindSDL2.cmake /
  FindSDL2_mixer.cmake（MODULE 模式），其 FIND_PATH/FIND_LIBRARY 只认自身
  缓存变量与环境变量（SDL2DIR 等），不消费 CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH 与 Conan
  CMakeDeps 生成的 *Config.cmake。Conan 依赖即使就绪，configure 仍报
  "Could NOT find SDL2"。

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           cmake-cache-var-injection
rec_description: >
  在配方 generate() 中用 CMakeToolchain 的 tc.variables 预置模块读取的缓存变量，
  指向依赖包内路径：SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR=<sdl2>/include、
  SDL2_LIBRARY=<sdl2>/lib/libSDL2.a、SDL2_MIXER_INCLUDE_DIR=<mixer>/include/SDL2、
  SDL2_MIXER_LIBRARY=<mixer>/lib/libSDL2_mixer.a。关键细节：
  FindSDL2 尾部以 SDL2_LIBRARY_TEMP 回写 SDL2_LIBRARY，若只注入 SDL2_LIBRARY，
  FIND_LIBRARY(SDL2_LIBRARY_TEMP) 可能意外命中系统同名库并回写覆盖注入值 ——
  TEMP 必须一并预置。静态链接时链接顺序须被依赖库在后（mixer 先于 SDL2）。
rec_command: >
  tc.variables["SDL2_INCLUDE_DIR"] = os.path.join(sdl2.package_folder, "include");
  tc.variables["SDL2_LIBRARY"] = os.path.join(sdl2.package_folder, "lib", "libSDL2.a");
  tc.variables["SDL2_LIBRARY_TEMP"] = <同 SDL2_LIBRARY>;
  tc.variables["SDL2_MIXER_INCLUDE_DIR"] = os.path.join(mixer.package_folder, "include", "SDL2");
  tc.variables["SDL2_MIXER_LIBRARY"] = os.path.join(mixer.package_folder, "lib", "libSDL2_mixer.a")
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-recipe-generate

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      patch-find-module
fallback_description: >
  补丁修改上游 Find 模块加入 HINTS 路径；侵入性更高，仅当缓存变量注入与
  上游模块逻辑冲突时使用。
fallback_auto_fix:      false

forbid_1_pattern:       patch.*FindSDL2\.cmake.*PATHS.*/data/service/hnp
forbid_1_reason:        把设备本机绝对路径写死进补丁属环境耦合，换机即失效
forbid_1_consequence:   CI 干净环境构建失败 / 其他机器不可复现

verification_cmd:       grep -n "SDL2_LIBRARY" build/*/CMakeCache.txt

